### [SIM] String collection, any(): only eq and search.in are allowed → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/filter-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "*",
  "filter": "tags/any(t: t ne 'pool')"
}

### [AZURE] String collection, any(): only eq and search.in are allowed → 400
