Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "*",
  "filter": "tags/any(t: t ne 'pool')"
}

### [SIM] Number collection, any(): ne is only allowed on its own → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/filter-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "*",
  "filter": "roomNumbers/any(n: n ne 101 and n gt 100)"
}

### [AZURE] Number collection, any(): ne is only allowed on its own → 400
