### [SIM] A lambda can only use its own range variable → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/filter-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "*",
  "filter": "rooms/any(r: r/beds gt 1 and rating gt 4)"
}

### [AZURE] A lambda can only use its own range variable → 400
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/filter-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "*",
  "filter": "rooms/any(r: r/beds gt 1 and rating gt 4)"
