### [SIM] Functions the simulator doesn't support, such as geo.distance → 400
# Simulator only: Azure supports geo.distance, so there the 400 is for the missing location field.
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/filter-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "*",
  "filter": "geo.distance(location, geography'POINT(2.35 48.85)') lt 10"
}

